# Rules Directory Index

This directory contains all coding standards, patterns, and architectural guidelines for the project. Rules are organized by technology (Astro-specific vs generic) and by domain (components, testing, performance, etc.).

## Organization

```
rules/
├── astro/          # Astro framework-specific patterns
├── generic/        # Reusable across projects
└── workflows/      # Process and methodology
```

