## Context Loading Guidelines

**When to Load Astro Rules:**

- Creating `.astro` files → Load `astro/components/` or `astro/layouts/`
- Working with content → Load `astro/content/`
- Styling → Load `astro/styling/`
- Performance → Load `astro/performance/`

**When to Load Generic Rules:**

- Any TypeScript work → Load `generic/code-quality/typescript.mdx`
- Writing tests → Load `generic/testing/`
- Error handling → Load `generic/error-handling/`
- Security concerns → Load `generic/security/`
- Performance optimization → Load `generic/performance/`

**Typical Session:**

- Load 1-3 rule files (~300-900 tokens)
- Prioritize files matching current task
- Use `relatedFiles` metadata for discovery

